+--!strict
+-- The Sunwarden boots (zone armour, the Sunwarden set): bronze greaves under
+-- a broad knee cop, a pale stone shin plate, a gold band at the ankle, and
+-- plated feet with a scraped toe cap. A scar is knocked into the right shin
+-- plate: the set has seen the ruin.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+-- Old green-bronze and pale ruin stone with sun gold: the Sunwarden palette.
+local bronze = { 96, 98, 66 }
